{"product_id":"applied-statics-and-strength-of-materials","title":"Applied Statics and Strength of Materials","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe seventh edition of Applied Statics and Strength of Materials presents an elementary, analytical, and practical approach to the principles and physical concepts of statics and strength of materials. It is written at an appropriate mathematics level for engineering technology students, using algebra, trigonometry, and analytic geometry. An in-depth knowledge of calculus is not required for understanding the text or solving the problems\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 0  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Leonard Spiegel P.E. Deceased | George F. Limbrunner \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780131228559 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44912382771353,"sku":"Aca-49780131228559","price":120.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/705f2b1503f48ae08847678062f254de.jpg?v=1729693058","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/applied-statics-and-strength-of-materials","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}